"Bye!", I say.
My family waves.
The call is over.
I close the laptop.
My flat is suddenly very quiet.
I am a little sad.
I need fresh air.
My jacket is very thin.
I go outside.
It is cold in January.
But a walk is good right now.
The street is almost empty.
There is a woman.
Who is that?
I do not know.
She walks by quickly.
I walk very slowly.
I still hear the voices from home.
My family is far away in Mexico.
But I am happy.
